    "displayName": "Storage Essential — Storage",
    "description": "**Essential** — Baseline hygiene for Storage: the non-negotiable controls every deployment should enforce from day one. This tier delivers RBAC and managed-identity controls eliminating shared credentials, TLS / HTTPS enforcement preventing in-transit interception, encryption-at-rest with service-managed keys, key and certificate lifecycle hygiene (rotation, expiration, validity), and backup, soft-delete, and purge-protection guards against accidental or malicious data loss. Together these policies protect…",
